Changes from 6.0.20 to 6.0.21 (2026-11-04)

- Updated: The form, feedback and call to action mails of collected information are the kernel's HTML mail with a plain-text part (Exponential kernels with notification.ini [MailSettings] HTMLLayout): each answer reads as on the result page, a form's recipient field still decides where the mail goes and the call to action still leads to its feedback page. On an older kernel the mails stay the plain text they were.

Upgrading: composer update and clear the caches.
